{"about_the_game":"&quot;Dynamic Destruction&quot; is an innovative destruction simulation game that immerses players in the captivating world of reverse engineering and creative destruction. In this game, players are tasked with demolishing various structures, ranging from simple walls to complex buildings, using a plethora of tools and construction elements.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAt the heart of &quot;Dynamic Destruction&quot; lies an advanced physics system that ensures realistic interaction between all elements of the game. Players can assemble their own custom siege machines using blocks, cannons, pistons, missile launchers, magnets, and many other components, each offering unique functionalities to creatively take down the target.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn summary, &quot;Dynamic Destruction&quot; is a celebration of creative destruction, offering a playful experience where ingenuity, strategy, and a penchant for chaos come together to create explosive entertainment.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2723340?t=1743240463","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723340/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743240463","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723340/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743240463","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723340/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743240463","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"&quot;Dynamic Destruction&quot; is an innovative destruction simulation game that immerses players in the captivating world of reverse engineering and creative destruction. In this game, players are tasked with demolishing various structures, ranging from simple walls to complex buildings, using a plethora of tools and construction elements.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAt the heart